            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati Barira Abisirayeli, uti Ni hagira umuntu uw’ari we wese, ar’ uwo muri mwebge Abisirayeli canke w’umunyamahanga aba muri mwebge, azoshikanira Moleki uwo mu bana biwe, ntaz’ abure kwicwa; abo mur’ ico gihugu baze bamwicishe amabuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
