        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ntihaze hagire uwambika ubusa nyinabo canke inasenge: ūzokora artyo azoba yambitse ubusa bene wabo: bazogībgako n’ukugabitanya kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
